        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "b40ae3df-14b7-5b89-ba41-757b5270edb3",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Works: Revengers Tragedy, The Revenger's Tragedy\n- People: Thomas Middleton, Christopher Eccleston, Derek Jacobi, Eddie Izzard, Diana Quick, Andrew Schofield, Carla Henry, Marc Warren, Justin Salinger\n- Characters: Vindice, Duke, Lussurioso, Duchess, Carlo, Hippolito, Castiza, Supervacuo, Ambitioso\n\nFacts:\n- The Revenger's Tragedy is a 1606 play that is attributed to Thomas Middleton in the credits of the film Revengers Tragedy, following current scholarly consensus.\n- Revengers Tragedy is a film adaptation of the 1606 play The Revenger's Tragedy.\n- Diana Marilyn Quick was born on 23 November 1946.\n- Diana Marilyn Quick is an English actress.\n- Christopher Eccleston stars in Revengers Tragedy as Vindice, a revenge-obsessed character.\n- Derek Jacobi stars in Revengers Tragedy as the evil Duke.\n- Eddie Izzard stars in Revengers Tragedy as Lussurioso, the Duke's lecherous son.\n- Diana Quick stars in Revengers Tragedy as the Duchess.\n- Andrew Schofield stars in Revengers Tragedy as Carlo, Vindice's brother, who is a version of the play's Hippolito.\n- Carla Henry stars in Revengers Tragedy as Castiza, Vindice's virtuous sister.\n- Marc Warren and Justin Salinger star in Revengers Tragedy as Supervacuo and Ambitioso, the Duchess's sons.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
